   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000028",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 28,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "一房を置きて隣れる吉江源次郎君より、かゝる憂き年は暮るゝも惜しからぬよし、人伝てに言ひ越しければ返し。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000029",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 29,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "濡衣の、春待つ人の心には、暮れ行く年ぞ、いそがれにける。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000030",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 30,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
