   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 34,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "一月二十四日、有罪の判決を受く、この日稀有の大雪。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000035",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 35,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "久方の、天きる雪のおもしろく、つもるにまかす、袖の上かな。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000036",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 36,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
