   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000043",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 43,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "監獄の門を出づる頃、雨は止みぬ。稲倉の峠下にて茶屋に憩ひけるに、山の陰に煙の立ち上るを、何ぞと尋ねけるに炭竃なりと主人の言ひけるにぞ。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000044",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 44,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "賤の男が、深雪かくれの炭竃も、立つ烟にぞ、世に知られける。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000045",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 45,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000046",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 46,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "峠の道にて",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000047",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 47,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "去年ながら、つもれる雪の消えそめて、今日ぞ深山も、春は来ぬらし。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000048",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 48,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "たどり行く、深雪の山のあなたには、霞たな引き、春ぞ見えける。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000049",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 49,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000050",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 50,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "保福寺峠を下り行くに、日漸く暮れて、鳥の声寂し。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000051",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 51,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "沢水に、鴨ぞ啼くなる。春を浅み、浮き寝の床や、寒けかるらん。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000052",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 52,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000053",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 53,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "上田警察署泊。雲間の月をながめて。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000054",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 54,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "たまたまに、影は見えつつ、村雲を、払ふ風なき、夜半の月かな。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000055",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 55,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000056",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 56,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "翌六日朝、汽車にて上田を立つ。浅間山の麓を行く。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000057",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 57,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "烟だに、見てなぐさまん。春霞、浅間の峯は、立ちなかくしぞ。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000058",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 58,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000059",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 59,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "碓氷峠を越ゆるに、春風暖く、そゞろ眠を催す。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000060",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 60,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "人知れぬ、霞かくれの花もあらん。香をだにつてよ、春の山風。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000061",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 61,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "鴬の古巣と見ゆる、谷かげに、まだ去年ながら、雪ぞ残れる。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000062",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 62,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "吹く風も、のどけき春は、旅衣、うすひの関も、知らで過ぎけり。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000063",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 63,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000064",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 64,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "六日七日両夜、上州松井田泊。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000065",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 65,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "のどかなる春の山辺も、夕暮の、鐘の音こそ、さびしかりけれ。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000066",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 66,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000067",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 67,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "八日夜、武州本庄泊。翌くる朝顧みて、浅間嶽の独り高く雲表に聳ゆるを遙に望み。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000068",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 68,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "浅間山、峯の白雪、まだ深し。春は、碓氷の関や隔つる。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000069",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 69,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000070",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 70,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "途上即興",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000071",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 71,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "ささ濁る、里の小川に袖濡れて、誰が妹ならむ、根芹つむなり。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000072",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 72,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "ほのかにも、去年の面影残るかな。霞かくれの遠山の雪。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000073",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 73,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "若草の野辺に打ち連れ、憂き今日の、春を昔に、語る日もがな。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000074",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 74,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "浅緑、春の野もせと一とつらの、川瀬のどかに、白帆行くなり。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000075",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 75,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000076",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 76,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "九日午時過ぐる頃、東京着、直ちに鍛冶橋監獄に入る。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000077",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 77,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "よそにのみ、都の春を、ながめつつ、雪ふる郷の、空ぞ恋しき。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000078",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 78,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000079",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 79,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "梅の花咲く頃",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000080",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 80,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "払はでぞ、ながめしなまし、白雪の、降るもおかしき、梅のあけぼの。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000081",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 81,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000082",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 82,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "誰が宿の、春は訪ふらん。わび人の、籬の外の、鴬の声。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000083",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 83,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000084",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 84,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "帰雁",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000085",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 85,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "夜さへも、とまらで帰る、かりがねは、故郷いかに恋しかるらん。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000086",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 86,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000087",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 87,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "桜の頃、或夜、風はげしく吹きければ。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000088",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 88,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "嵐こそ、うしろめたけれ。桜花、行きて見るべき、我身ならねば。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000089",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 89,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000090",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 90,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "故山を思うて",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000091",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 91,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "春おそき、片山里の桜花、誰を待ち得て、咲かんとすらん。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000092",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 92,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000093",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 93,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "食膳の蕨を見て",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000094",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 94,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "萌え出づる蕨を見れば、山人も、捨てし浮世の、春ぞ恋しき。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000095",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 95,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000096",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 96,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "運動場にて、落花を拾ひて、袖に収めけるを看守の見て咎めければ、二首。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000097",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 97,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "香をだにも、袖にとゞめて、あかず散る、花の夕の、思ひ出にせん。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000098",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 98,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "またも来て、訪ふ宿ならぬ花なれば、散り行く影の、なほぞ恋しき。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000099",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 99,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000100",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 100,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "この年、三月に閏ありと聞きければ、",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000101",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 101,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "常よりも、のどけき春と、きくものを、何をいそぎて、花の散るらん。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000102",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 102,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000103",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 103,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "散る花の、流れて行けば、川下に、また物思ふ人やあるらん。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000104",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 104,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "柴人か、つま木に添ゆる花見れば、深山の春ぞ、恋しかりける。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000105",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 105,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "降る雨に、散りしく梨の花見れば、春の日ながら、寂しかりけり。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000106",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 106,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000107",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 107,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "我無言にして、牢獄の苦をも解せざるものゝ如しなど、同房の人々誹りければ。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000108",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 108,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "神にさへ、見せじと思ふ、口なしの、花の心を、知る人もがな。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000109",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 109,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000110",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 110,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "降るとしも、空には見えず、花の上の、露のみまさる、雨の夕暮。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000111",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 111,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000112",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 112,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "春の暮るゝ日",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000113",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 113,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "惜めども、限ありけり。行く春の、今を別れの、入相の鐘。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000114",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 114,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000115",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 115,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "春の行きける明けの朝",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000116",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 116,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "色あせて、散りかふ花も、今朝はまた、春のかたみと、恋しかりけり。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000117",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 117,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000118",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 118,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "白き夏の衣を恵まれける人への返し",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000119",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 119,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "桜花、たよりも聞かで過ぎつれば、春なき年と、思ひぬるかな。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000120",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 120,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000121",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 121,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "五月雨の頃",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000122",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 122,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "故郷の、山田の乙女、濡れつつや、早苗とるらん、五月雨の空。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000123",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 123,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "訪ふ人も、なき憂き宿は、五月闇、雨の音にぞ、なぐさまれける。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000124",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 124,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000125",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 125,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "鉄窓に倚りて、夕間暮、遠く市中の灯火を眺めつゝ。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000126",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 126,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "螢とも、見てなぐさまん。鉄の窓、へだつる町の、ともし火の影。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000127",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 127,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000128",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 128,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "蝉声",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000129",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 129,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "明日知らぬ、露の命を思へばや、夕闇かけて、蝉の鳴くらん。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000130",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 130,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000131",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 131,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "構外に笛声を聞きて、戯に。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000132",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 132,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "夕闇に、声も忍びて、吹く笛を、あはれ、よそにや君は聞くらん。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000133",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 133,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000134",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 134,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "人目なき、浮世の外と、思ひしに、夢驚かす、暁の鐘。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000135",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 135,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000136",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 136,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "秋もやゝ近く来ぬらし、夕されば、音づる軒の風の寂しさ。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000137",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 137,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000138",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 138,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "雁の声を聞きて",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000139",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 139,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "別れにし、春のまゝなる、憂き宿の、枕にまたも、かりがねの声。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000140",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 140,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000141",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 141,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "虫声",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000142",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 142,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "うきふしの、旅寝の身さへ、忘れけり。枕に近き虫の声々。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000143",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 143,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000144",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 144,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "旅なる人を思うて",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000145",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 145,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "君が行く方も知らねど、夕されば、空のかただに、ながめぬるかな。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000146",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 146,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "夕間暮、軒の草葉の、そよぐさへ、君がたよりの、風と見るかな。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000147",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 147,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000148",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 148,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "七夕",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000149",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 149,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "一と年に、今夜ばかりは、渡守、天の川舟、はやも漕がなん。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000150",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 150,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000151",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 151,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "不図目ざめけるに、隈なき月光、玻璃窓より差入りで、枕を照らす。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000152",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 152,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "草枕、露も涙も、あらはなる、寝覚め恥づかし、武蔵野の月。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000153",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 153,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000154",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 154,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "九月八日、我が生まれし日なれば、故郷の空思ひ乱れて。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000155",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 155,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "故郷は、荒れまさるとも、菊の花、今日は忘れず、咲きにほふらん。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000156",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 156,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000157",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 157,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "控訴公判期日の近く迫りける頃、戯に。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000158",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 158,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "故郷に、誰れ帰るとて、立田姫、紅葉の錦、織りて待つらん。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000159",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 159,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000160",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 160,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "十月五日、公判始めて開かるゝ日、東京控訴院の監房にて、母の身をのみ思ひ耽りつゝ、",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000161",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 161,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "言葉にも、顔にも出さで、たらちねは、東の空や、眺めたまはん。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000162",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 162,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000163",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 163,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "同じくは、露に濡れても、きりぎりす、野辺に鳴く音を、尋ねてしかな。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000164",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 164,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000165",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 165,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "木葉散りて、八重洲橋上の行人、窓より見ゆ。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000166",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 166,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "木の葉散りて、居ながら見ゆる人影を、世に珍らしく思ひぬるかな。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000167",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 167,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "今はまた、春のかたみと、何を見ん。しぐれの雨に、柳散りけり。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000168",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 168,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000169",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 169,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "夜もすがら、しぐるる空を、玉水の、絶えぬ軒端の音に聞くかな。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000170",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 170,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000171",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 171,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "監房の造作、船室の如しなど、人々笑ひ興じければ、",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000172",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 172,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "思ふとも、空吹く風の、甲斐なくて、浪にまかする、船の道かな。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000173",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 173,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000174",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 174,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "久方の、空飛ぶ鳥も、迷はぬを、道なき世とは誰か言ひけん。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000175",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 175,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000176",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 176,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "十一月十八日、公判。雨降る。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000177",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 177,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "今日しもぞ、干さんと待ちし我が袖を、時雨の雨に、またしぼるかな。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000178",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 178,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000179",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 179,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "同じき日の夕暮、控訴院よりの帰途、馬車の内にて。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000180",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 180,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "濡るるとも、いとひはせじな、夕時雨、明日の晴れなん、空をたのめば。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000181",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 181,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000182",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 182,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "十二月七日、判決の日、暁天の月に対して。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000183",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 183,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "明日の夜は、晴れて待ち見ん、うきふしも、なれしむとやの、窓の月影。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000184",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 184,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000185",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 185,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "同じき朝、今日を限りの寝具を収むるとて。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000186",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 186,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "しかすがに、なれし枕ぞ惜まるる。幾夜うき寝の、今朝の別れ路。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000187",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 187,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "○",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000188",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 188,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "無罪の判決を受けて監獄に帰り、別房に移されて、裁判所より出獄の通知を待つ。夕方迎へられて知人の家に赴く、夜半目覚めて枕頭の灯影に驚く。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "aozora-043241-000189",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 189,
   "vol": "",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "有明の、なれぬ灯影に驚きて、暫しは迷ふ、夢かうつつか。",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  }
 ]
}
